not see answers 404 and a forbidden action 403: platform_core.authorization.deny().
Lists start from access.selectors.scope_to_context().

Document every operation with drf_spectacular's @extend_schema, reusing
platform_core.openapi (error_responses, IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_PARAMETER).
"""
